From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seeed Rockchip BSP <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: use Python 3 for FIT BL31 decoder

The Radxa vendor FIT generator invokes decode_bl31.py directly.  The
Scarthgap build environment provides Python 3, while the vendor script still
advertises the removed Python 2 interpreter.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py
--- a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/decode_bl31.py
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-#!/usr/bin/env python2
+#!/usr/bin/env python3
